OL,3,AMouldy, infested housing for vulnerable
OL,4,Apeople sold as ethical investments     
OL,5,Aabroad                                 
OL,7,F"This building is hell on Earth," says 
OL,8,FPhil, describing the black mould and   
OL,9,Frats at Castleview House, the block of 
OL,10,Fflats in Runcorn, Cheshire, where he   
OL,11,Flives.                                 
OL,13,FBut to an estate agent called Britske  
OL,14,FReality - which translates as British  
OL,15,FReal Estate - working with investors   
OL,16,Fhundreds of miles away in the Czech    
OL,17,FRepublic, the flat Phil rents through  
OL,18,Fhis benefits was an exciting business  
OL,19,Fopportunity.                           
