OL,3,AMouldy, infested housing for vulnerable
OL,4,Apeople sold as ethical investments     
OL,5,Aabroad                                 
OL,7,FThe estate agent's marketing material  
OL,8,Fsaid the flat was a government-funded  
OL,9,Fsource of income for investors, where  
OL,10,Ftenants were taken care of and the     
OL,11,Fproperty was in excellent condition.   
OL,13,FA Czech investor bought it last year   
OL,14,Ffor #163,150, more than double the     
OL,15,F#75,000 cost of similar apartments in  
OL,16,Fthe block.                             
